{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39476","headline":"蓟北书事 · 张蠙","name":"蓟北书事","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"度碛如经海，茫然但见空。\n戍楼承落日，沙塞碍惊蓬。\n暑过燕僧出，时平虏客通。\n逢人皆上将，谁有定边功。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张蠙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39476.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39476","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}